    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'WASD / Arrow keys     Move through the environment

    Mouse                          
    Look around and use controls

    E                                    Examine
    a nearby device

    Esc                                Pause or close the current
    overlay


    Limits: five pairs of guided and independent questions (10 total),
    then activate the portal.

    Bridge: complete guided and independent questions,
    install three components and rescue the calf.

    Case: complete four modules,
    lift the cover and deactivate the device.


    Basic hints and the case manual
    are free. Stronger support uses one heart.

    Pause > Save & return preserves
    accepted work. Continue resumes it.

    Wrong answers preserve progress and
    count towards accuracy.'
